    {
      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "f98207d85c9f88ee3fd08fcd37336c50",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"ms-and-msbar-at-the-same-scale\">MS and MSbar at the same scale</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/QED/OneLoop/Renormalization2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">second QED reference</a>\ncompares <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta=1/\\epsilon+c_\\Delta||)</marimo-tex> with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1/\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>, where\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(c_\\Delta=\\log(4\\pi)-\\gamma_E||)</marimo-tex>. With <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D=4-2\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>,\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-2/(D-4)=1/\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1007.4716\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OneLOop, Eq. (2)</a> divides its masters by\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_\\Gamma=\\Gamma(1-\\epsilon)^2\\Gamma(1+\\epsilon)/\\Gamma(1-2\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>.\nConverting to <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\mu^{2\\epsilon}\\int d^D\\ell/(2\\pi)^D||)</marimo-tex>, with the common\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i/(16\\pi^2)||)</marimo-tex> stripped off, multiplies the result by</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[(4\\pi)^\\epsilon r_\\Gamma=1+c_\\Delta\\epsilon+O(\\epsilon^2).||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">Thus a normalized master <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(P/\\epsilon+F||)</marimo-tex> becomes\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(P/\\epsilon+F+c_\\Delta P||)</marimo-tex>. MS subtracts its pole; MSbar subtracts its pole\nand the <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(c_\\Delta P||)</marimo-tex> term. Actual OneLOop tadpole and bubble values check this\nconversion independently, and the generated CT amplitudes cancel the\ncorresponding loop terms in both schemes.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The finite column below is the counterterm's <strong>subtraction constant</strong> at a\ncommon scale. It is not a computed finite loop amplitude.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='RGSE-0' random-id='fd09565e-cfe4-f7be-8794-f01e9221a3db'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Z\u03c8&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-xi/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-(eps*xi*cDelta+xi)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zm&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-3/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-3*(1+eps*cDelta)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;ZA&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-4/3*Nf/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-4/3*(eps*Nf*cDelta+Nf)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Z\u03be&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-4/3*Nf/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-4/3*(eps*Nf*cDelta+Nf)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Ze&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;2/3*Nf/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;2/3*(eps*Nf*cDelta+Nf)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;ZAm&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='6' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='true' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
